<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT-Clintrials cut to neutral.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT-Clintrials cut to neutral.</headline>
<text>
<p>--Vector Securities analyst John Kreger said he reduced his rating on ClinTrials Research Inc to neutral from buy.</p>
<p>--Shares in the clinical research services concern were off 3/4 to 41-1/2.</p>
<p>--&quot;Since troughing in late July, CCRO is up 40 percent to command a 45 forward P/E multiple,&quot; Kreger said.</p>
<p>--Chicago Newsdesk 312-408-8787</p>
</text>
